WEBVTT

00:02:28.811 --> 00:02:30.938
For years, I thought I was a coward.

00:02:30.938 --> 00:02:35.026
Unlike my fiancée,
I chose the pen, not the gun.

00:02:35.026 --> 00:02:39.322
I chose to set up
a legal defense organization,

00:02:39.322 --> 00:02:44.243
stood with brave Indigenous
women and men as barefoot lawyers.

00:02:44.994 --> 00:02:46.579
I struggled between hope and fear

00:02:46.621 --> 00:02:48.080
when they asked,

00:02:48.122 --> 00:02:49.832
"Can we really trust the laws?"

00:02:51.292 --> 00:02:53.252
I barely had time to ponder.

00:02:53.294 --> 00:02:58.090
You see, when Indigenous peoples,
activists protested,

00:02:58.132 --> 00:02:59.717
they were tagged as communists.

00:02:59.759 --> 00:03:02.595
So we set up quick reaction teams